&lt;p style="margin-left: 70px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 14px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 14px"&gt;戦略審議委員会における主な検討内容は次のとおりです。&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 98px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -14px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 14px"&gt;・事業ポートフォリオ戦略&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 98px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -14px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 14px"&gt;・製品供給戦略&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 98px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -14px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 14px"&gt;・Rx事業戦略&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 98px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -14px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 14px"&gt;・サステナビリティ戦略&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 98px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -14px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 14px"&gt;・中長期成長戦略&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="style_pb_after" style="line-height: 1; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 42px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;
